window.products.push({"id":412198,"name":"HITSLAM Shower mat Non Slip, 24 x 32 Inch Bathtub Mat Non Slip with Drain, Soft PVC Loofah Shower Bath Mat for Tub, Quick Drying Bathroom Shower Mat, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918lm5KAxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Suction Cups: Our non slip shower mat are designed with a no suction cups anti-slip layer, which helps hold shower floor mat firmly in place while being gentle on the bathtub. Instead of traditional bath mats with difficult cleaning suction cups, Our mat would not slide around and damage your tub or floor surface. Non Slip and Safety: Featuring more secure and durable plaid backings, our bath tub mat non slip remains steadily in place even on wet surfaces. The texture on the top surface of tub mat enhances friction to keep you from slipping or falling in the bathtub. Highly Efficient Drainage: Hollow loop surface and lattice bottom create hundreds of drain holes allows water and air to circulate which helps prevent water and stains buildup and keep the bathtub mat dry and clean quickly. Premium Quality for Maximum Comfort: High quality soft PVC loofah shower mat for textured tub surface with ideal thickness will be comfortable for your shower in bare feet, gently massages your feet and exfoliating your skin, keep you away from cold floor. Phthalate Free and odorless. Great for the elderly, baby and young kids. Easy to Clean and Fast Drying: This bath tub mat is easy to clean, simply rinse the foam or hair off the mat with the showerhead and hang it in a ventilated area to dry. Fast drying and keep its fresh appearance, easy maintenance, too. Trimmable and Perfect Sizes: Customizable bathtub mats! Trim to your desire size and shape make the mat fit perfectly in any corner of your house. This bathtub mat for shower comes in 24 x 32 inches, which fits for most bathtubs and floor. Available in 4 popular colors to match virtually any bathroom decor theme, perfect choice for home, gym, or spa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918lm5KAxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HITSLAM","source_asin":"B0B8HMCMRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8HMCMRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8HMCMRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
