window.products.push({"id":412206,"name":"I Love You Throw Blanket, Blanket with Love for Best Friends, Couples, and Family, Perfect Heartfelt Gift for Loved Ones (Blue) - BlankieGram","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y7fD-JbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SOFT LOVE BLANKET: Conventional flowers will fade away and greeting cards are often set aside. Our warm and soft throw blanket is covered with messages of love that will warm the heart of the one you care about the most. Our throw is perfect as an anniversary gift for a husband or wife. It's also excellent as a Valentines Day gift for a girlfriend or boyfriend. \"SELECTION OF SOOTHING COLORS: Our cute throw blankets for men and women are made in a variety of vibrant colors that will help make anyone feel joy and love. Colors include pink, purple, teal, blue and grey. These colorful throws are a great way to say, \"\"I love you to the moon and back!\"\" \" \"BLANKIEGRAM GIVES BACK: Every purchase helps BlankieGram donate blankets to people who might not otherwise receive an inspiring gift from a loved one. Buying an I Love You BlankieGram is not just a gift of affection for a friend or partner, but also a way to help us reach our goal to \"\"Cover the World in Hugs.\"\" \" NO SHEDDING OR SHRINKING: Our lightweight and soft love blankets are carefully crafted from premium materials, ensuring you'll get a product that won't shrink when washed. Our love throw blankets are manufactured to never shed, which makes them a durable gift that will show your adoration for that special someone in your life. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Our incredibly cozy love blanket is easy to care for. Simply wash it separately using your favorite detergent in cold water on a gentle cycle. Afterwards, tumble dry the comfy throw using low temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y7fD-JbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlankieGram.com","source_asin":"B07PCM4FYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PCM4FYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PCM4FYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
