window.products.push({"id":412208,"name":"AIFEEL 8 in 1 Stand Mixer 800W, 8.5QT Bowl, Multifunctional Kitchen Mixer with Dough Hook, Whisk, Beater, Meat Grinder, Blender etc,5-Speed with LED K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NGEv7fUkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8-in-1 Multifunctional Stand Mixer】:Aifeel Kitchen food mixer comes with meat grinder, blender, dough hook, whisk, beater, pasta roller, sausage kit, cookie presses etc. It will be your perfect kitchen machine for making cakes, breads, cookies, pastry, juicer, meat sauce and more. Also with splash guard helps add ingredients without making a mess. 【5-Speed with Pulse Function】There is a LED control panel with 1-5 speed button and a 'P' pulse button. You can choose from a slow stir to a fast mix, perfectly suitable for different recipes. The additional pulse setting can reach the highest speed in a second (Used for rinsing the juicer cups or making smoothies) 【Powerful Motor with Over-heating Protection】800 Watt electric kitchen mixer handle your work all like a charm. Built-in temperature sensor chip, it will automatically shut down when overheating, safe to use. Suggest don't operate it over 9 minutes per time.(Notice: The machine will automatically stop after 9 minutes of use) 【Large Capacity & Classic Design】8.5QT food grade stainless steel bowl can meet almost all your kitchen needs. The classic retro red housing and stainless steel decoration belt make your kitchen more colorful. The Tilt-head design allows you removing the mixing bowl and replacing the beaters or dough hooks easily. 4 Anti-slip silicone suction cups keep the machine steady in place while working. 【After-sale Service】Aifeel stand mixer comes with 1 year quality warranty. Feel free to contact our aftersale team if you meet any problem. We will give you a satisfied solution. ★Since some attachments are made of die-cast aluminum. Pls don't wash it in the dishwasher, it might oxidize.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NGEv7fUkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIFEEL","source_asin":"B08FYG44G3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FYG44G3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FYG44G3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
