window.products.push({"id":412343,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld - Gokilife Electric Whisk Drink Mixer Mini Foam Maker Hand Foamer for Bulletproof Coffee, Latte, Cappuccino, Hot Chocolate, Prot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BIy3wZcaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Anti-Shake Design】: With more than 10 years of experience in research, development and production of milk frother, we have developed this anti-shake milk frother. Firstly, the triangle stabilizer stabilize the pole to prevent it from falling off and tilting. Secondly, the thickened pole helps prevent the shaking caused by the deformation of the pole. Finally, the two split whisk heads are redesigned to be easier to disassemble and install, which can prevent shaking caused by replacing pole. 【 Quick & Powerful】: Our milk whisk stirrer machine is made of the best quality stainless steel. It has an extra powerful rapid motor of 19000 rpm ,which will froth your milk in 5-10 seconds, and the double spring durable long 18/10 stainless steel spiral whisk that won't rust or break. It delivers double the power of single whisk foamers and professional espresso makers. It’s easy to use and barely makes noise. 【Easy To Use & Clean & Stroge】: By pressing one big button on the top of the milk foamer which is powered by 2 AA batteries (not included), it will make milk foam right away in 10 seconds. The detachable whisk head redesign will help you wash the whisk faster and easier than other designs. The transparent lid of the portable handheld milk frother can be used not only to protect the milk frother wand when traveling, but also as a stand to support the milk frother. 【Durable & Environmental Materials】: The milk frother is made of food-grade premium stainless steel + ABS plastic, which is sturdy and durable, not easy to rust, even with daily use will not break or bend. With ergonomic and cylindrical handle design, that is comfortable to grip and easy to operate. The built-in powerful low-noise (<20dB) motor brings stronger rotation speed (19000 rpm) without disturbing your families and gives you a calm and tranquil morning. 【 Perfect Gift With Gokilife】: Gokilife milk frother help you make rich creamy foam, just like a professional barista. You can give it to your friends and families. Let them enjoy the convenience and fun of making chocolate or cappuccino at home. Enjoy the elegance, simplicity and flavor of a rich bubble drink anytime, anywhere. If you have any questions or need any help, please feel free to contact us. We are always here for you !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BIy3wZcaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gokilife","source_asin":"B09N71ZZNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N71ZZNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N71ZZNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
