window.products.push({"id":412415,"name":"Umbra Prisma Picture Frame, 5x7 Photo Display for Desk or Wall, Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wVtyYaVKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a new dimension to your favorite photos by displaying them in the original geometric wire picture frame from Umbra Introducing the Prisma Frame CollectionWith Prisma Picture Frames you can have a stunning dimensional display for your favorite photos, or other images. Prisma’s innovative design floats your photo between two panes of glass, while allowing the geometric frame to show through. This creates a truly original presentation for your cherished memories. Placed on a tabletop or mounted to your wall, Prisma photo frames can be presented vertically or horizontally. Use it to show off special photos from a vacation, wedding, graduation, or family photo shoot. Start adding dimension to your special photos by ordering the Prisma photo frame today. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wVtyYaVKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B088L6466D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088L6466D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088L6466D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
