window.products.push({"id":412417,"name":"MOONIGHT TIME Plastic Pants Hangers, Skirt Hangers Space Saving, Closet Organizer Storage Hangers for Pants, Skirts, Shorts, Jeans, Black 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m4GaXT8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【New Design Patent】The pants hangers made of high-quality PP plastic, environmentally friendly, tasteless, beautiful color, thick clothes rail, good toughness, strong and durable, not easy to deform, 3 classic colors, black, grey, white for your choice, Double-pole ladder-shaped skeleton design, suitable spacing, one pole with six hangers,can be flexibly assembled and disassembled freely, and the double hook head can be rotated 360°, convenient for hanging in different way 【Multifunctional Folding Pants Hangers With Movable Clips】360° freely rotatable hook head, smooth flexible strong load-bearing, horizontal and vertical use, make full use of space, Good toughness clothes hangers with non-slip clips, strong hangers rod, round and smooth bayonet, easy to installing, not snagging the clothes, The pants hangers with telescopic clip, freely adjustable spacing, suitable used for children and adult clothes, also a nice storage skirt hangers for coloset 【Non-slip Strong Clips, No trace, No damage to Clothes】Because of understanding your life, we know better what you need in your daily, this storage pants hangers is fully equipped with one rod, six racks, 12 clips with high-quality elastic non-slip clothespins, strong clamping force, no indentation, no damage to clothes, long time hanging and not falling off, perfect choice for housewives daily use, help mom do good Closet Organization 【Six In One Foldable Design To Save Space】One functional hanger instead of six standard hangers, convenient for storage, release your wardrobe press, integrates the sense of technology into your life, the pant hanger can be horizontal and vertical hanging freely switching, horizontal hanging have directly viewing, easy and convenient to take the cloth you need, vertical hanging saving 6 times space, making the storage neat and beautiful, help your wardrobe accommodate with more clothes 【More Useage】The Pant hangers not only limited to wardrobe storage organizer, but can also be used to dry clothes on the balcony without being blown away by the wind, when you travel, the hangers organizer can help you saving the trouble of tidy cloth and keeping your pants and other cloth flat, a convinent travel companion functional hangers, Warm tips: please store the pant hangers in a place no direct sunlight after drying outside to prevent the hanger from early aging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m4GaXT8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOONIGHT TIME","source_asin":"B094HB4F9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094HB4F9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094HB4F9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":412418,"name":"Christmas Wreaths for Front Door, Classical Christmas Door Decorations for Christmas Party, Fireplaces Walls New Years Christmas Decorations Indoor Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BBPbUOY5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Christmas Wreath: The christmas door wreath is in a classic Santa color red and green desig, decoration with a bottom ring dotted with a variety of styles of plump berry clusters, large red bows, golden reindeer, balls, flowers, green pine branches, and Merry Christmas letters, perfect to fill your decorative area. Our winter Wreaths are the best choice for Christmas decorations. Beautiful and Unique: Each Christmas wreath is handmade and unique. Our faux garlands are made of premium materials that are super realistic and natural, feel real from color to texture, and look as glamorous as the real thing. This lush, high-quality wreath will welcome family and friends and turn your door into a warm and inviting entrance. It's an indispensable Christmas decoration for your family. Easy to Hang Up: This Christmas wreath comes with a string that you can easily hang anywhere you want to decorate. If it is outdoors, it is recommended to hang it on a covered porch to avoid direct sunlight and rain. The garland material is durable, you can even hang them all year long and they'll look like new by next Christmas! Ideal size: At 16 inches, the wreath looks very plump, is not only suitable for decorating the door, but can decorate more areas as you need. Doors, windows, fireplaces, walls, indoor or outdoor can be hung to add a strong Christmas atmosphere and attract the attention of neighbors and passers-by. Note: The wreath leaves have been tightened for ease of transportation and you can manually unfold the wreath leaves to optimum size upon receipt. Perfect Christmas Decoration:Our winter wreath is the best choice for Christmas interior decoration. Hang it up and welcome to the happy holiday with your family and friends.Note: The wreath leaves have been tightened for ease of transportation and you can manually unfold the wreath leaves to optimum size upon receipt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BBPbUOY5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEFANS","source_asin":"B0BLVP6BYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVP6BYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVP6BYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":412419,"name":"10-Cup Drip Coffee Maker, Grind and Brew Automatic Coffee Machine with Built-In Burr Coffee Grinder, Programmable Timer Mode and Keep Warm Plate, 1.5L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPEy3NK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【1.5L LARGE CAPACITY】: The Grind Coffee Machine can brew up to 10 cups coffee. Set the number of coffee powder (2,4,6,8,10) through pressing \"CUP 2-10\" button base on your own needs. If not, the default number of cup is 10.【NOTE: when making coffee, the amount of coffee powder added should correspond to the amount of water, if the machine finishes without running out of corresponding amount of water, you can start it again. ☕ 【EASY TO OPERATE】: Depending on your personal preference, choose coffee beans or coffee powder to make drip coffee. The coffee machine is equipped with a burr grinder, so you can brew a cup of fresh coffee with coffee beans. The coffee beans are gathered and ground by the burr grinder, retain the full flavor of the beans, then the coffee powder will fall directly on the filter. ☕ 【OPTIMUM FLAVOR THROUGH BREWING SETTINGS】: With 3 strength control settings and 8 coffee grind control grade, create your desired drink. A conical burr grinder lets you choose from 8 grade, from coarse to fine, for the best results by bean type and desired drink. Three settings deliver coffee just the way you like it, with a choice of strong, medium, or mild for flavor customized to your taste. Press the \"GRIND OFF\" button if you need the coffee machine to stop grinding coffee powder. ☕ 【AUTOMATIC START FUNCTION】: Entering the timer mode and setting the time you wanted to automatic start, the programmable timer will preset the machine start time and start brewing coffee at the specified time. There is a prompt bell after brewing. It helps to save time making coffee in the morning. After brewing, there is a warming plate design that the coffee can be warmed in the carafe lasts for 120 minutes. ☕ 【BLOOMING FUNCTION】: The machine features blooming function for retaining a more full-bodied coffee aroma. The coffee grounds are moistened with hot water before each brewing and will swell up, which will help the coffee taste become more intense.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPEy3NK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gevi","source_asin":"B0C6MJCV4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6MJCV4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6MJCV4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
