window.products.push({"id":412523,"name":"GOHD Peacock Pride. Clipped Voile. Voile Jacquard Window Curtain Panel Drape with Attached Fancy Valance and Taffeta Backing. 2pcs Set. Each pc 54 inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c7qYOR37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This curtain is of double layer. Front layer is clipped voile / voile jacquard with big repeat geometric design of vivid peacock tail feather look. Backing is taffeta fabric in matching solid color. One curtain rod is enough to have nice curtain with both valance & backing now. It also gives flexible way for you to either tie the front curtain or the backing or together to achieve different decoration effect and meet different needs for the light. The curtain is with attached fancy valance, which can add royal accent to your decoration and can beautify your house much better. Curtain with attached fancy valance is difficult and slow for production as only the most skillful labors can manage it. As a try, we provide EXTRA FABRIC TIEBACKS FOR THIS DESIGN ONLY RANDOMLY. It will be greatly appreciated if review can be left advising whether such fabric tie-backs are needed or not. Thanks. Front clipped voile/ voile jacquard fabric can realize nice decoration effect, while medium weight backing taffeta can well protect your privacy as it cannot be seen through. However, please be kindly noted that it is NOT blackout fabric and some light can still go through it. Front voile ground and taffeta backing is of RUST color, while the clipped voile pattern and valance is of silver grey color. Such combination helps to achieve an ELEGANT CONTRAST COLOR effect, which is quite different with matching color idea of most other curtain designs. This curtain can attract attention of any visitor to your house and can win great praise for you. Eleborately designed and adopted shining yarn in the clipped voile pattern is an extra shining point for the curtain This curtain is of classic RUST color. Thanks to its pattern and different fabrics of the double layer, it can show multi shade of the color so that it can easily match with most similar colors. The BIG REPEAT geometrical pattern of vivid peacock tail feather look and royal fancy valance design makes it easy to match with and even brighten most home decorations. RUST, TEAL GREEN color are also available for this design. Please check the pictures for your reference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c7qYOR37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOHD GOLDEN OCEAN HOME DECOR","source_asin":"B07N8S9Y1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N8S9Y1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N8S9Y1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
