window.products.push({"id":412542,"name":"Lasko 2505 Portable Electric 36”Oscillating Tower Fan with Fresh Air Ionizer, Timer and Remote Control for Indoor, Bedroom and Home Office Use, 36 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uw0Ev71eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Lasko 2505 Tower Fan is 36” tall with a black body. The sturdy plastic base assembles easily with a phillips-head screwdriver, and occupies a 12” x 12” footprint on your floor. This sleek, vertical space saving design allows you to put the fan in small places, where other fans won’t fit without sacrificing air circulation, style or comfort. Powered by 3 quiet speed settings, this fan helps you beat the heat. The fan delivers excellent air flow but is still quiet enough to hear the TV – even on HIGH. The fan creates just the right amount of white noise making it ideal for sleeping at night when it’s warm and stuffy. Tall enough to aim over a high bed and powerful enough to reach across the room. If you live in the heat with no central air, or your window units do a poor job of moving air around your home or apartment, this fan creates excellent air flow and will help make you feel cooler. The fan is lightweight, portable and easy to operate. It comes with remote control, optional oscillation, programmable timer and a built-in Ionizer to help freshen the air in your room. The Ionizer disperses millions of negative ions into the air that bond with positively charged ions which include things like dust, bacteria, pollen, smoke and other allergens. Once the bond is formed, the particles become heavier and fall to the ground thus the air feels naturally fresher. Lasko has been making quality household products for over 100 years. Lasko tower fans are ETL Listed and come with our patented Blue Plug safety fuse technology making them a safe choice for a cooling fresh air breeze when it’s hot and humid outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uw0Ev71eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lasko","source_asin":"B08CCYLDPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CCYLDPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CCYLDPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
