window.products.push({"id":412579,"name":"Travel Pillow, Inflatable Airplane Pillow, Ergonomic and Portable Head Neck Rest Pillow for Fully Support, Soft Flight Sleep, Designed for Planes, Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MyxtAaCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you ever have these problems? Hard to fall asleep except in your bed Can't sleep comfortably while traveling Pillow is oversized not easy to carry Couldn't find a comfortable sleeping position Wrong posture when napping resulting in aching back, neck and shoulder NOW! CHOOSE US! Enjoy Superior Comfort Wherever You Are! THERAPEUTIC DESIGN- The DCHomewares Travel Pillow is specifically designed for natural ergonomics. With over five ways to use the travel pillow, you will finally be able to find peaceful rest while traveling. No more sore backs or kinks in your neck. Travel comfortably in a natural forward position, which allows you to watch movies, play games or music on your phone within your pillow. You'll feel refreshed arriving at your destination. INFLATE AND DEFLATE IN LESS THAN 30 SECONDS Inflate and deflate your Travel Pillow with a Few Breaths of Air and Release the Air with the simple Press of One Button VERSATILE AND LIGHTWEIGHT The Travel Pillow weighs less than a pound and comes with a compact travel bag, making it easy to carry with you wherever you go. This is perfect for long airplane trips, trains, cars, buses, office napping, nanny nap, poppy flop, trucks, or even camping. MULTI USE AND ADJUSTABLE FIRMNESS Since this travel pillow is inflatable, you can choose the firmness. It can be used to prop yourself up on a plane or deflated so that it could be used as a pillow while camping. The holes in the pillow are designed to help you stay comfortable while sleeping. Snuggle and cuddle your pillow, sleep longer. Packages Includes: 1 x Inflatable Travel Pillow 1 X User Manual 1 x Durable Storage Bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MyxtAaCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DCHomewares","source_asin":"B071VTSFHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071VTSFHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071VTSFHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
