window.products.push({"id":412700,"name":"BAYKA Floating Bathroom Shelves for Kitchen Coffee Bedroom Decor, Wood Wall Mounted Rustic Floating Shelves for Home Storage, Over The Toilet Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LR6nuwThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wood 2 Pack Space Organizer with Hooks - What's Changed? It consists of two flexible shelves, one of which is equipped with a towel rack and 8 additional stainless steel hooks, It’s able to install the shelves separately and customize the height between them. The simple appearance design, while saving space, is also perfectly combined with the decoration concept of open space. Fall Prevention Design - Why Is It needed? The metal protective guards can prevent items on the shelf from falling, so that the available space can be maximized. The shelf is made of Paulownia wood with a torched finish and the metal bracket is coated with powder to prevent corrosion. Each shelf has a load-bearing capacity of 40 pounds, which means it can meet most of the storage needs. Large Space for Storage - Where to Install? Dimension:16.53 x 7.2 x 6.3 inch. The combination of large capacity shelf and multiple hooks can be applied to the kitchen, bathroom, powder room or the coffee bar where there are disheveled items. Re-organize them in the extra space to suit your storage and display needs. Easy to Install and Store - What Are the Steps? Unfold the bracket; install the board and the towel bar; fix the bracket on the wall; attach the hooks on it. The shelf can be used as a towel rack when the hooks are removed. It can also be folded and hidden when not in use in the future. Thoughtful Gift - Why Purchase This Product? The sturdy structure, rustic look and easy installation makes this a great addition to your home, especially if there are children or pets in the family. Our beautiful wall shelves are an awesome way to display collectibles, making them a perfect gift for family or friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LR6nuwThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAYKA","source_asin":"B098R2MGNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098R2MGNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098R2MGNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
