window.products.push({"id":412717,"name":"DOWAN Funny Butter Dish, Cute Bear Butter Dish with Lid, Ideal Gift For Friends, Mom, Melting Yellow Glacier, Blue and White Gradient Design, Perfect ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mEYXv69UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made A Great Gift. This funny butter dish does an excellent job in portraying the water at the bottom with polar bear hanging out on top of an iceberg. From its clean blue and white color scheme with gradient at the bottom, to the little bear topping the lid, this cute butter dish would make a great gift for birthdays, housewarming, or Mom's Day. The Concept of Design. With global warming and glacier melting, polar bears are facing a crisis of losing habitats. Butter will melt and flow at a certain temperature, just like \"yellow\" glacier. Hope this funny butter dish can lead us to a low-carbon life. Non-slip Bear Handle. The small bear handle on the top of butter dish makes it easy to lift the lid, and the raised edge of the butter dish prevents the lid and butter from slipping down. Easy to Clean-The butter dish is made of ceramic, which has a smooth surface. It is very easy to clean grease and dessert residues left in the butter dish. This butter dish with lid is microwave, dishwasher and freezer safe. Healthy Ceramic Material. Unlike plastic and metal materials, our butter dish has no harmful plastics, cadmium or lead. And it's absolutely rust proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mEYXv69UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWAN","source_asin":"B096FF6GJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096FF6GJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096FF6GJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
