window.products.push({"id":412752,"name":"Valance Curtains for Kitchen Window, Blue Universe Space Beautiful Galaxy Rod Pocket Valances Window Treatments Short Curtains for Bedroom/ Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bvGUPteML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blue Universe Space Beautiful Galaxy Rod Pocket Valances ;3 Inch High Pole Pocket Works Well With Tension Rods Or Normal Rods. Here Are 8 Reasons That Should Make You Consider Adding This Beautiful Style Of Window Treatment To Your Own Room.:1. Soften Up A Cold And Uninviting Room. 2. Add Height To A Room. 3.Bring The Room Together.A Valance Can Help You Use The Same Fabric And Color Scheme In The Entire Room.4. Great For Homes With Children And Pets. Most People Don’T Realize It, But A Valence Is The Go-To Window Treatment Interior Designers Choose For Homes That Have Children Or Pets. 6. A Less Expensive Alternative To Roman Shades. 7. Feature A Unique Fabric Pattern.Fabric Design Trends Nowadays Are Becoming More And More Colorful And Artistic. And What Better Way To Feature A Special Fabric Than On A Flat Window Valance? Maybe You’Ve Fallen In Love With A Unique Novelty Fabric Print That Looks Like A Piece Of Art. By Having This Pattern Centered In The Middle Of A Flat Valance, You’Re Essentially Creating A Window Treatment That Looks Like A Piece Of Art Or A Piece Of Tapestry; Our Custom Digital Print Works Well With Many Decorating Styles Like French Country Style, Modern Farmhouse Style Etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bvGUPteML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vandarllin","source_asin":"B09FF1YGVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FF1YGVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FF1YGVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":412753,"name":"Soft Velvet Stretch Fitted Dining Chair Seat Covers, Removable Washable Anti-Dust Dining Room Upholstered Chair Seat Cushion Cover Kitchen Chair Prote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517EZqWR2jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soft Velvet Stretch Spandex Dining Room Upholstered Chair Seat Covers; Perfect fitted for Your Furniture Make your chair seats look brand new with these super stretchable seat covers. Made of soft smooth stretchy velvet fabric, making it extra cozy and comfortable. It's hard to believe just how soft this cover is until you feel it! Not only is it beautiful, but the velvet material is durable enough to protect your furniture. Like a glove design with elastic edge, it's secures the cover in seconds and easily hides torn, dirty or worn-out upholstery. Whether you’re looking to breathe new life into an old set of dining chairs, or trying to keep a new set looking fresh, our slipcovers contour to dining chairs for a custom-like fit. A look sure to impress even the most critical guests! We do recommend measuring your furniture seat width before purchase to ensure you have the perfect fit. Recommend size: Chair seat cushion width 14''-19'' and depth 14''-19'' and thickness 1.5''-3''. 1. Double check your chair seat size when you release order before; please See our MEASURING GUIDE in the photos. 2.Please allow 1cm-2cm error due to manual measurements, yours understand will be much appreciated. The cover is machine washable remove and dryable, so you can keep your cover looking fresh and new, time and time again! Please note: we do recommend washing and drying your slipcover before first use to remove any wrinkles. Every purchase includes a 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee: This chair seat cover is sold with a full money-back guarantee. If you are at all unsatisfied with your product, please contact us (through Amazon if past the standard return window) and we will be happy to assist you. At the end of the day we want our customers to be happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517EZqWR2jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FWQ","source_asin":"B07Q72P617","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-412753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q72P617","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q72P617","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
